    {
      "id": 48,
      "msgctxt": "498368",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "\n―――#[Hold up][Errrr]#.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "msgctxt": "498396",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "What is he, streaking…?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "msgctxt": "498528",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But, well, I won't complain now. I lost 90% of\nmy belongings in coming to this side. I'll\nresign myself to abject poverty for a spell.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "msgctxt": "499048",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Those events are but a dream now,\nbut the battles you waged were real.\nAnd so I'm here now.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "msgctxt": "499200",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I thought #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF wasn't able to come over to this side!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "msgctxt": "499340",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I also looked into the Servant you were with\non this side. Its class was a #C000246204Berserker#CDEF…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "msgctxt": "499776",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF speaks matter-of-factly.\nI take in his arrogance with both shock and acquaintance.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "msgctxt": "500188",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I take his outstretched hand.\nLeaving one #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF, I use two.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "msgctxt": "500700",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "――――Yeah.\nI can't be standing around here.",
      "pt": ""
    },
