      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "msgctxt": "509504",
      "tipo": "unk_op1659",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF.",
      "pt": "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "msgctxt": "509560",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF.",
      "pt": "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "msgctxt": "509644",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game.",
      "pt": "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "msgctxt": "509724",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving.",
      "pt": "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "msgctxt": "509792",
      "tipo": "unk_op1653",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Would you like to save your Clear Data?",
      "pt": "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "msgctxt": "509832",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "Are you sure you wish to exit",
      "pt": "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "msgctxt": "509864",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "without saving the Clear Data?",
      "pt": "sem salvar os Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "msgctxt": "509896",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Hmph. I arrived ahead of you to find this room\nlacking as well. Truly, this layout reeks of\nyour modesty.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "msgctxt": "510004",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "―――I remember. I remember now―――!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "msgctxt": "510044",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This is the extraordinary Servant that I contracted\nover in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF―#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "msgctxt": "510176",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Right, we took care of the disaster #C236196003BB#CDEF\nbrought about in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "msgctxt": "510292",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Good. Your memory is in order. You're not like\nthe other Masters. You managed to contract me,\noriginally a dweller of the #C000246204Far Side#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "msgctxt": "510440",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I―――I don't really understand, though.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "msgctxt": "510484",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I broke that rule. Since I was awake,\nI figured I would seek some amusement\nas I took my legs for a stretch.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "msgctxt": "510596",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Once they had lost sight of you,\nthey didn't hesitate to sever your contract.\nYou were abandoned by your own pet.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "msgctxt": "510712",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Even I didn't anticipate that. It would've\ndisgraced me if you had been expelled due to the\nlack of a Servant rather than elimination.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "msgctxt": "510848",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You're someone I contracted with―jest or not.\nYour end must come after expending your all in\na battle ultimately beyond your ability.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "msgctxt": "510984",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Welling up within is me a feeling of wonder, and something else.\nI don't really know why, but I can't help but grin.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "msgctxt": "511104",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "So, what will you do?\nThere's a Servant here.\nAnd he's not particularly preoccupied.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "msgctxt": "511192",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "If you seek to rise to the top with me,\nthen take my hand. THIS time, it's your rightful\nmoment to invoke those #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "msgctxt": "511336",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "First: we will be as equals.\nI swear on this #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF\nthat we will be free to believe in one another,\nrespect one another, and if need be, confront one another.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "msgctxt": "511520",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "With this next seal―――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "msgctxt": "511548",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "―――Is that so? A fine oath, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nWith this, you've proven yourself\nworthy of unleashing my blades for.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "msgctxt": "511676",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Let's go, Master. We head for the #C000246204Moon Cell's\nCore#CDEF, the seat of Heaven's devoted. Let the\nexpected become the unexpected with me here.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "msgctxt": "511828",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I look at the petal in my hand one more time.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "msgctxt": "511876",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…it's all just a dream now,\nbut I know for sure that there was once a girl:",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "msgctxt": "511956",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "A girl who defied the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF to protect something.\nI'll probably find out what her wish was once I advance.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "msgctxt": "512084",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "My battles continue.\nAnd ever they will until I reach the Moon Cell's Core,\nwaiting at the end of the seven seas――",
      "pt": ""
    }
  ]
}
